# Sources

Read this before a rule of this skill needs backing, before citing a source in a
`// SAFETY:` comment, a doc or a review, and before adapting a rule from
somewhere else. It says what each source holds, which rule it backs, where this
skill departs from it, and the notice owed for the text it adapts. Cite one of
these, or an equally primary source; open the page before linking it.

